Additional learning directions
My next steps are to explore:

mutual information as a quantitative measure of shared dependence;
phylogenetic correction, because related sequences are not independent samples;
direct-coupling methods that try to distinguish direct from indirect sequence relationships;
causal diagrams for separating prediction from mechanism; and
